CHAPTER.VERS:
And now, because ye have done all these works, saith the LORD, and I spoke to you,
That is, I never ceased to warn you, as in (Isa_65:2; Pro_1:23). rising early and speaking, but ye heard not; and I called you, but
He shows the only remedy to redress our faults: to allow God to lead us in the way, and to obey his calling, (Isa_66:4). ye answered not;
